msgstr "Wala"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Graph Tree"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "I-mirror ang hierarchy ng SmokePing sa isang graph tree: nagiging branch ang bawat seksyon, at nagiging host ang bawat kagamitan sa ilalim ng branch ng mga target nito. Ginagamit muli ang mga umiiral na branch at host."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Isang bagong tree, pinangalanan sa ibaba"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Huwag i-mirror"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Pangalan ng Bagong Tree"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Para lamang sa isang bagong tree. Gagamitin ang isang tree na mayroon nang ganitong pangalan."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Binabasa ng Preview ang configuration at inililista kung ano ang gagawin ng pag-import. Walang isinusulat hanggang sa kumpirmahin mo ang listahang iyon sa susunod na screen, at hindi kailanman isinusulat ang sariling mga file ng SmokePing."

