msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "Poller ng SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Ang Cacti poller na tumatakbo sa, o nagbabahagi ng filesystem sa, host ng SmokePing. Ang poller lang na ito ang nagbabasa ng data ng SmokePing."

